# Force Unix line endings for shell scripts on every checkout.
# Windows (Git for Windows, core.autocrlf=true) converts LF to CRLF on
# checkout, which breaks scripts the Docker build executes: a CRLF
# shebang (#!/bin/bash\r) makes the kernel fail with "no such file or
# directory" at container start. This rule keeps .sh files LF everywhere.
*.sh text eol=lf
